DigestCacheLib::markAsVerified
├── when marking a digest
│   └── it marks digest as verified
├── when marking multiple digests
│   └── it marks all digests as verified
├── when marking with multiple permissions
│   └── it marks each permission independently
├── when marking same digest multiple times
│   └── it remains verified (idempotent)
└── given edge cases
    ├── when account is zero address
    │   └── it works correctly
    ├── when digest is zero
    │   └── it works correctly
    └── when permissionId is zero
        └── it works correctly